#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T0.P29..P31
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=Apprentices become injured when forced to train hard during times of low Stamina or if their Mood is bad. There are three levels of injuries竭ｬsevere, normal, and light竭ｬand each require a different amount of time to hea…
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 1d 00 00 00 08 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "13572"
msgid "Injuries"
msgstr "Lesiones"

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=10
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T10.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=10
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T0.P32
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T0.P32..P33
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=Apprentices ditch training when Trust is low, their Mood is bad, or if they have little remaining Stamina. When an apprentice ditches, he does not participate in that particular training slot.
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 20 00 00 00 08 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "13576"
msgid "Ditching"
msgstr "Abandono"

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=11
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T11.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=11
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T0.P34
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T0.P34..P36
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=Mood and Trust are the core of efficient training. Mood has five levels. The better the Mood, the better the training results and performance during fights. Good Mood means less ditching and fewer injuries.
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 22 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "13580"
msgid "Mood/Trust"
msgstr "Ánimo / Confianza"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "260_Saejima"
msgid "So this is the Sodachi Notebook? Looks like it's packed with useful information."
msgstr "¿Este es el cuaderno de Sodachi? Se ve que está lleno de información útil."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tournaments
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Tournaments
msgctxt "284_Saejima"
msgid "Every student's goal is to win a tournament. Work to have your students win in as few turns as possible. The sooner the victory, the better the prize purse and the easier it is to earn a good evaluation and rank."
msgstr "El objetivo de cada aprendiz es de ganar un torneo. Trabaja duro para hacer que tus alumnos ganen en la menor cantidad de turnos posibles. Mientras antes sea la victoria, mayor será el premio y más fácil será ganar una buena calificación y rango."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Tournaments
msgctxt "296_Saejima"
msgid "For the most money and best evaluation, you have to win <Color:7>within 15 turns<Color:Default>. After that, the prize purse slightly decreases every five turns."
msgstr "Para obtener la mayor cantidad de dinero y la mejor calificación, tienes que ganar en <Color:7>15 turnos<Color:Default>. Entre más turnos, el premio irá disminuyendo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P4
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Tournaments
msgctxt "308_Saejima"
msgid "You will be forced to compete in a tournament on the 50th turn. Do your best to win a tournament in fewer than 50 turns."
msgstr "Tendrás que competir en un torneo el turno 50. Haz lo mejor para ganarlo en menos de 50 turnos."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Tournaments
msgctxt "320_Saejima"
msgid "All tournaments are eight-man tournaments. Therefore, you must win three fights to win the entire tournament. You will be fighting skilled opponents, so make sure to come prepared and healthy."
msgstr "Todos los torneos tienen ocho participantes. Por lo que debes ganar tres peleas para ganar el torneo. Lucharás contra poderosos oponentes, así que asegúrate de ir preparado."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Training Menu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Training Menu
msgctxt "332_Saejima"
msgid "The training menu consists of four Regular Slots and one Special Slot. A combination of these five slots constitutes one turn."
msgstr "El menú de entrenamiento consiste en cuatro casillas normales y una especial. La combinación de esta constituye un turno."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Training Menu
msgctxt "344_Saejima"
msgid "Regular Slots consist of basic training that will boost various abilities. There are nine different types of training sessions. Each student has his strengths and weaknesses. Assess the student's abilities as you create his menu."
msgstr "Las casillas normales consisten en entrenamiento básico que potenciará ciertas habilidades. Hay nueve tipos de sesiones de entrenamiento. Cada estudiante posee sus debilidades y fortalezas. Evalúa las habilidades de cada estudiante mientras creas su menú."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P8
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Training Menu
msgctxt "356_Saejima"
msgid "The Special Slot is for more irregular training, such as learning Finishing Moves and sparring. You can also use this slot to have your student participate in tournaments and various matches."
msgstr "La casilla especial es para un entrenamiento más irregular, como aprender movimientos finales y sparring. También puedes usar esta casilla para que tu discípulo participe en torneos o en diferentes combates."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Exhibition Matches
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=4
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Exhibition Matches
msgctxt "368_Saejima"
msgid "Exhibition matches are single match fights. You can participate in these matches using the Special Slot. Winning these single match fights will earn you money which can be used to enhance the dojo's facilities."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Exhibition Matches
msgctxt "380_Saejima"
msgid "There are 15 types of matches, each with a different level, event period, and prize purse. Three of the 15 events will be listed during each turn, so make sure to check what is available."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P11
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Exhibition Matches
msgctxt "392_Saejima"
msgid "Exhibition matches will enhance your abilities whether you win or lose, so try to participate as often as possible. However, losing will cause your student's Trust and Mood to slightly decrease."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Finishing Moves (Overview)
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=4
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (Overview)
msgctxt "404_Saejima"
msgid "Finishing Moves are techniques that allow you to inflict major damage to your opponents during fights. Finishing Moves can be learned by selecting \"Master Finishing Moves\" from the training menu."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_choice_index=4
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (Overview)
msgctxt "416_Saejima"
msgid "There are a total of ten different types of Finishing Moves, but each student can only equip one. Make sure to check the details of a move before equipping it, as each move differs in power and conditions for use."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_choice_index=4
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (Overview)
msgctxt "428_Saejima"
msgid "The variety of Finishing Moves that apprentices can learn will increase with the number of specific actions that Saejima himself learns."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=5
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
msgctxt "440_Saejima"
msgid "Equip your apprentices with Finishing Moves to enable them to turn the tide in a tough fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P16
#. y4:msg_choice_index=5
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
msgctxt "452_Saejima"
msgid "To have your apprentice execute a Finishing Move, use rapid button presses to fill the Finishing Gauge. Once it is full, you will be able to give the word. Make sure you get the timing down just right."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P17
#. y4:msg_choice_index=5
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
msgctxt "464_Saejima"
msgid "Immediately after giving the order, a button command will be displayed. Pressing the correct button at the right time will result in a successful finish. If you fail, your apprentice will take a brutal hit from the opponent."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_choice_index=5
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
msgctxt "476_Saejima"
msgid "The deeper your apprentice's Trust, the easier the button command and the faster the gauge will increase. Therefore, developing Trust is crucial in executing a successful Finishing Move."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P19
#. y4:msg_choice_index=5
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
msgctxt "488_Saejima"
msgid "However, Trust decreases each time you use a Finishing Move. Using too many may cause you to lose the Trust that you worked hard to develop. Make sure to use Finishing Moves with moderation and at the proper timing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P20
#. y4:msg_choice_index=5
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Finishing Moves (During Fights)
msgctxt "500_Saejima"
msgid "Also, please be aware that after you've used a Finishing Move twice during a fight, the amount of damage the subsequent finish moves does will be halved. The gauge will also not increase as quickly as before."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Skills
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=7
#. y4:msg_choice_index=6
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Skills
msgctxt "512_Saejima"
msgid "Fights and training will be more to your advantage if you equip students with skills. There are a total of ten skills, and up to three can be equipped at a time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P22
#. y4:msg_choice_index=6
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Skills
msgctxt "524_Saejima"
msgid "Students can learn new skills through conversations with Saejima or by repeating certain training. Learn more skills and find good combinations to make fights and training more effective."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Enhancing Facilities
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=8
#. y4:msg_choice_index=7
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Enhancing Facilities
msgctxt "536_Saejima"
msgid "Use the Enhance Facilities function to pay to upgrade the dojo's facilities and boost the efficiency of training."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P24
#. y4:msg_choice_index=7
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Enhancing Facilities
msgctxt "548_Saejima"
msgid "You can only enhance facilities for the nine regular training sessions. All facilities start at Level 1 and can be enhanced to Levels 2 and 3 by paying money."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P25
#. y4:msg_choice_index=7
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Enhancing Facilities
msgctxt "560_Saejima"
msgid "Please note that the dojo must undergo renovations to enhance its facilities from Level 2 to 3. The option to undergo renovations will become available as you train your apprentices."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P26
#. y4:msg_choice_index=7
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Enhancing Facilities
msgctxt "572_Saejima"
msgid "Enhancing facilities is vital to efficient training. Work hard to earn money in fights and create the perfect training environment!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=27
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P27
#. y4:msg_speaker=Dojo Rank
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=9
#. y4:msg_choice_index=8
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Dojo Rank
msgctxt "584_Saejima"
msgid "The dojo rank represents the dojo's current rank. You can raise the rank by winning exhibition matches and tournaments, as well as enhancing the dojo's facilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596_Saejima"
msgid "The dojo rank can be raised until all of the apprentices have been trained. Do your best to reach rank S－the highest possible rank－by the time you finish training all of the apprentices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608_Saejima"
msgid "Apprentices become injured when forced to train hard during times of low Stamina or if their Mood is bad. There are three levels of injuries－severe, normal, and light－and each require a different amount of time to heal."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P30
#. y4:msg_choice_index=9
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Injuries
msgctxt "620_Saejima"
msgid "Once injured, you can only select Rest as a training menu option until they heal. If an apprentice is injured during a turn, all remaining menu slots will automatically switch to Rest."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P31
#. y4:msg_choice_index=9
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Injuries
msgctxt "632_Saejima"
msgid "Resting while injured does not have the same effects as resting during a normal training session. Instead, the apprentice's abilities will decrease with each slot. Make sure the apprentices take rests periodically so they do not get injured."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=32
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P32
#. y4:msg_speaker=Ditching
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
#. y4:msg_choice_index=10
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ditching
msgctxt "644_Saejima"
msgid "Apprentices ditch training when Trust is low, their Mood is bad, or if they have little remaining Stamina. When an apprentice ditches, he does not participate in that particular training slot."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=33
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P33
#. y4:msg_choice_index=10
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ditching
msgctxt "656_Saejima"
msgid "Ditching causes all abilities to decrease, so be careful. The probability to ditch differs with each apprentice. Do your best to maintain Trust and provide a reasonable training menu."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=34
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P34
#. y4:msg_speaker=Mood/Trust
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=12
#. y4:msg_choice_index=11
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Mood/Trust
msgctxt "668_Saejima"
msgid "Mood and Trust are the core of efficient training. Mood has five levels. The better the Mood, the better the training results and performance during fights. Good Mood means less ditching and fewer injuries."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=35
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P35
#. y4:msg_choice_index=11
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Mood/Trust
msgctxt "680_Saejima"
msgid "Trust also has five levels. The higher the Trust, the more your apprentice will listen to orders and the less they will ditch. It'll also increase the efficiency of solo training and make it easier to use Finishing Moves in fights."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P36
#. y4:msg_choice_index=11
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Mood/Trust
msgctxt "692_Saejima"
msgid "Mood can be improved through training sessions such as stretching and Trust can be boosted through meetings, sparring, and winning fights. Make sure to train your apprentices with not only their abilities and health in mind, but also their Mood and Trust."
msgstr ""

